    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Monotonic stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Data stream</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/online-stock-span/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 901</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Online Stock Span</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The span of today's price reaches back to the last day with a strictly higher price. Keep a stack of (price, span) with prices strictly decreasing; a new price pops every lower-or-equal entry and adds its span. Each price is pushed and popped at most once: amortised O(1) per call.</p>\n"
